                    "body": "I do have a suggestion tho, if it is possible to check if `\"nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter-textobjects\"` is installed and try to load it after mini ai has been loaded.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I do have a suggestion tho, if it is possible to check if <code class=\"notranslate\">\"nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter-textobjects\"</code> is installed and try to load it after mini ai has been loaded.</p>",
